## The runs

# Every code point's values, as runs `first << 32 | value`, ascending, each
# run reaching to the next: the Line_Break value is bits 0 to 5 of `value`,
# Word_Break 6 to 10, Sentence_Break 11 to 14, Grapheme_Cluster_Break 15 to
# 18, Indic_Conjunct_Break 19 and 20, East_Asian_Width 21 to 23, each an
# index into its list of names; bit 24 is Extended_Pictographic, 25 Emoji, 26
# Emoji_Presentation, 27 Default_Ignorable_Code_Point; bits 28 to 30 group
# the general category: 1 Cn, 2 Pi, 3 Pf, 4 Mn, 5 Mc, 6 Me, 7 Cc or Cf, 0
